@startuml
title UML state machine diagram

state Idle
Idle : entry/To action
Idle : do/Remain in same state
Idle : exit/Login / Register

state Register
Register : entry/Register
Register : do/Register after validating
Register : exit/Login/Invalid registration

state InvalidRegistration
InvalidRegistration : entry/Invalid registration
InvalidRegistration : do/Cannot register
InvalidRegistration : exit/Abnormal termination

state Login
Login : entry/Login
Login : do/Login using valid username and password
Login : exit/Invalid login/To home page

state InvalidLogin
InvalidLogin : entry/Invalid login
InvalidLogin : do/Cannot login
InvalidLogin : exit/Abnormal termination

state ReadBlog
ReadBlog : entry/To home page
ReadBlog : entry/Read blogs of recovered patients
ReadBlog : exit/Idle

state UpdateCurrentNoOfInfectedPeople
UpdateCurrentNoOfInfectedPeople : entry/To home page
UpdateCurrentNoOfInfectedPeople : do/Update current no. of infected people in the locality
UpdateCurrentNoOfInfectedPeople : exit/View

state ViewNumberOfInfectedPeopleInTheLocality
ViewNumberOfInfectedPeopleInTheLocality : entry/View
ViewNumberOfInfectedPeopleInTheLocality : do/View number of infected people in the locality
ViewNumberOfInfectedPeopleInTheLocality : exit/Idle

state NoOfDeathsInTheLocality
NoOfDeathsInTheLocality : entry/View
NoOfDeathsInTheLocality : do/View no. of deaths in the locality
NoOfDeathsInTheLocality --> CheckLocationValidity : User_requests_weather_info
NoOfDeathsInTheLocality : exit/Idle

state CheckLocationValidity
CheckLocationValidity : entry/View
CheckLocationValidity : do/Check location validity
[*] --> ChooseWeatherInfo : Valid location / Invalid location

state ChooseWeatherInfo
ChooseWeatherInfo : entry/Choose weather info
ChooseWeatherInfo : [Valid location] --> CheckWeatherInfo : Temperature / Humidity / Rainfall / Pressure / Dew point
ChooseWeatherInfo : [Invalid location] --> InvalidLocation : Invalid location

state CheckWeatherInfo
CheckWeatherInfo : entry/Check weather info
CheckWeatherInfo : do/Update and show selected weather information to the user
CheckWeatherInfo : exit/AdditionalDetails

state AdditionalDetails
AdditionalDetails : entry/View additional weather details
AdditionalDetails : [*] --> ViewAlerts / WeeklyAnalysis / FuturePrediction / Graph
AdditionalDetails : exit/Idle

state InvalidLocation
InvalidLocation : entry/Invalid location
InvalidLocation : do/Cannot check weather for invalid location
InvalidLocation : exit/Abnormal termination

state Logout
Logout : entry/To action
Logout : do/End the session when the user logs out
Logout : exit/Idle

state ViewAlerts
ViewAlerts : entry/View
ViewAlerts : do/View alerts
ViewAlerts : exit/AdditionalDetails

state WeeklyAnalysis
WeeklyAnalysis : entry/View
WeeklyAnalysis : do/View a weekly analysis
WeeklyAnalysis : exit/AdditionalDetails

state FuturePrediction
FuturePrediction : entry/View
FuturePrediction : do/View a future prediction
FuturePrediction : exit/AdditionalDetails

state Graph
Graph : entry/View
Graph : do/View a graph
Graph : exit/AdditionalDetails
@enduml
